None of us have a real clue what exactly is the reason ICE is abducting people. Their stated reason is pigshit only a fool would believe. What is the common thread among victims? If you don’t know that, you do not know that you won’t be next.

//

The ICE officers were masked. They drove unmarked vehicles. They acted like cartel henchmen who went to a police surplus auction. When bystanders questioned them, they accused them of obstructing justice. Because in this America, asking questions about an abduction makes you the criminal.

//

The mere fact that they put on gear with POLICE emblazoned on it DOES NOT MEAN THEY ARE NOT CRIMINALS.

If visuals are all you need to submit to violent evil, I’ll put IRS on my back and knock on your door next.
